  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Enter a TIC ID, see the TESS target pixel file with nearby catalog sources overlaid, build light curves from chosen pixels, and compare with ZTF/ASAS-SN light curves to find out whether a variable signal comes from the target or a blended neighbour. Data used in the run: public. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
